    彭 | péng | surname Peng; drumming sound | Has 壴 on the left of 彡 instead of 景
    彰 | zhāng | manifest; clear | Has 章 on the left of 彡 instead of 景
    须 | xū | beard; must; necessary | Has 彡 on the left of 页 instead of right of 景
